      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Our IoT and OT Security Testing Services</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Each engagement is scoped to your devices, networks and operating constraints. These are the services we offer, from a single product to a whole plant.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("chip") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">IoT Device Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess connected products end to end, from hardware interfaces and boot process to authentication, data storage and remote management, to find ways to take control of a device.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("bug") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Firmware Analysis and Reverse Engineering</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We extract and inspect firmware for hard-coded credentials, outdated components, insecure update mechanisms, debug access and weak cryptography that cannot be seen from the network.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("gear") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">OT, ICS and SCADA Security Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We review controllers, HMIs, historians and engineering workstations for weaknesses in configuration, access control and remote access, using methods planned around safe operation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("segments") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">IT/OT Network Segmentation Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We check how corporate, DMZ and plant networks are separated, reviewing firewall rules, jump hosts, vendor access and shared services against the zones and conduits you intended.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("wifi") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Industrial Protocol and Wireless Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test industrial protocols such as Modbus, OPC UA and MQTT, and wireless links such as Wi-Fi, Bluetooth Low Energy and Zigbee, for missing authentication, weak encryption and abuse.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("buildings") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Smart Infrastructure and Building Systems Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess building management, access control, CCTV, lighting and energy systems, which are often installed by third parties and rarely reviewed after handover.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("agent") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Robotics and Automation Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test robots, automated guided vehicles and automation cells, including their control interfaces, update channels and connections to the systems that direct them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("cloud-sync") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">IoT Cloud, Mobile and API Backend Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test the apps, APIs and cloud platforms that manage devices, because a weakness there can expose or control every device at once.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

