      <div class="deliver__media rv">
        <article class="xfind" aria-label="Example IoT and OT security finding">
          <header class="xfind__head">
            <span class="xfind__tag">Example finding</span>
            <span class="xfind__sev">High</span>
          </header>
          <h3 class="xfind__title">Office network can reach production controllers because a firewall rule allows the whole subnet</h3>
          <dl class="xfind__rows">
            <div><dt>Category</dt><dd>Weak IT/OT segmentation · Insecure industrial protocol</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>From a corporate workstation, the Modbus TCP service on a production controller responded. A rule written for a vendor allowed the whole office subnet through the DMZ firewall. Read access was verified; no commands were sent, in line with the agreed safety rules.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Recommended fix</dt><dd>Replace the subnet rule with an allow-list for named engineering hosts, route vendor access through a monitored jump host and disable the unused service where possible.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Retest</dt><dd>Fixed. The controller is no longer reachable from the office network.</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </article>
